{
  "description": "R8: marking A then B links them both ways in the graph, an a11y node confirms it, and after a restart drilling into B lists A",
  "requirement": "R8 (GPUI Phase 1)",
  "notes": [
    "graph-backlinks.json seeded; rows in list_links order (updated_at DESC, rowid DESC): row 1 Decoy Unrelated, row 2 Gamma Doc, row 3 Beta Post. A = row 1 (Decoy Unrelated), B = row 2 (Gamma Doc); they are not linked in the fixture.",
    "The mark key is ⌘L (spec R8, ruling R-n; key `cmd-l`), as in the Tauri browser (B1): plain L types into the always-focused filter (R5).",
    "ubilink-core stores one row per unordered pair and links_of reads either end, so the graph step's unordered pair is links_of(A) ∋ B and links_of(B) ∋ A; the restart + drill proves the B side through the app.",
    "Confirmation text follows the Tauri browser: Linked “A” ↔ “B” (README contract)."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "graph": "graph-backlinks.json"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "A and B not linked yet",
      "graph": true,
      "no_links": [
        [
          "https://decoy.example/unrelated",
          "https://gamma.example/three"
        ]
      ],
      "link_count": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "open the browser",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "browser"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "browser"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "A is row 1, selected",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "nth": 0,
        "state": {
          "selected": true
        },
        "text": "https://decoy.example/unrelated",
        "deep": true
      },
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "mark A, move to B, mark B",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "cmd-l down cmd-l"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an a11y node confirms the link",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "Linked “Decoy Unrelated” ↔ “Gamma Doc”"
      },
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "the graph links A and B (one unordered row: both directions)",
      "graph": true,
      "links": [
        [
          "https://decoy.example/unrelated",
          "https://gamma.example/three"
        ]
      ],
      "link_count": 4,
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "restart (the link must be in the graph, not the view)",
      "restart": true
    },
    {
      "graph": true,
      "links": [
        [
          "https://decoy.example/unrelated",
          "https://gamma.example/three"
        ]
      ],
      "link_count": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "open the browser again",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "browser"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "browser"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "B is row 2",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "nth": 1,
        "text": "https://gamma.example/three",
        "deep": true
      },
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "down right"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "drilled into B",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "Linked to Gamma Doc"
      },
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "name": "B's connections list A (and its existing link)",
      "see": [
        {
          "role": "ListItem",
          "text": "https://decoy.example/unrelated",
          "deep": true
        },
        {
          "role": "ListItem",
          "text": "https://subject.example/note",
          "deep": true
        }
      ],
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem"
      },
      "count": 2,
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing launched",
      "call": "opened",
      "expect": {
        "": {
          "eq": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
